abstract: >-
  A manuscript developing a constructive approach to the lattice mass gap
  over every simply connected compact simple group, together with its
  in-progress Lean 4 formalization: two libraries, MassGap and
  MassGapChecks, Lean core alone, every declaration at the empty axiom set
  and every check module decided by the kernel. The relativistic continuum
  construction includes a pending mathematical obligation for exact
  spacetime covariance. The TeX is authoritative and the Lean is its
  transcription. The README gives an overview of established results and
  the mathematical and formalization work still to complete.
